WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:01.267 --> 00:00:03.136
-More with Michael Keaton
when we come back.

00:00:03.136 --> 00:00:05.237
♪♪

00:00:05.237 --> 00:00:08.241
Do you mind? I'll do a couple
promos saying that you're here.

00:00:08.241 --> 00:00:11.711
You can put that there.
I'm just gonna --

00:00:11.711 --> 00:00:13.046
You don't have to do anything.

00:00:13.046 --> 00:00:14.481
-Really?
-Yeah.

00:00:14.481 --> 00:00:16.949
These are just commercials.
-I'm willing to do something.

00:00:16.949 --> 00:00:19.085
-This one is...

00:00:19.085 --> 00:00:21.054
-[ Laughs ]

00:00:21.054 --> 00:00:23.223
-[ Laughs ] All right.
What do we do?

00:00:23.223 --> 00:00:24.591
We go, uh...

00:00:24.591 --> 00:00:26.192
-Look at all the toys
you have back there,

00:00:26.192 --> 00:00:27.393
all the stuff you have.

00:00:27.393 --> 00:00:28.895
-There's not really
that many great things.

00:00:28.895 --> 00:00:32.698
There's, like,
a lot of Purell and...

00:00:32.698 --> 00:00:36.936
Uh, how about I say, like,
"We have a great show,"

00:00:36.936 --> 00:00:38.138
and then I go,
"You wanna squirt?"

00:00:38.138 --> 00:00:39.239
-Sure.

00:00:39.239 --> 00:00:40.940
-And we'll end it on
"Wanna squirt?"

00:00:40.940 --> 00:00:42.875
-Yeah, okay. Wait. It has to end
on "Wanna squirt?"

00:00:42.875 --> 00:00:45.211
-Yeah. Do you want to say it?
-By the way, does it --

00:00:45.211 --> 00:00:48.147
I hope it means
"Would you like a squirt?"

00:00:48.147 --> 00:00:50.316
as opposed to
"Do you want to squirt?"

00:00:50.316 --> 00:00:52.352
[ Laughter ]

00:00:52.352 --> 00:00:54.821
[ Applause ]

00:01:00.293 --> 00:01:03.028
-I never got to that question,
did I? Yeah.

00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:05.031
[ Laughs ]

00:01:05.031 --> 00:01:08.501
Hi, Scott. Hi, Anne-Marie.
Michael Keaton is here tonight.

00:01:08.501 --> 00:01:10.637
Michael Keaton!
Plus we have Heidi Klum

00:01:10.637 --> 00:01:12.172
and an in-studio performance

00:01:12.172 --> 00:01:14.073
from Vince Staples
featuring Fousheé.

00:01:14.073 --> 00:01:15.775
Is there something
you would like to ask?

00:01:15.775 --> 00:01:17.643
-Do you want a squirt?
-Sure.

00:01:17.643 --> 00:01:19.311
-Okay.
-Back to you guys.

00:01:19.311 --> 00:01:22.281
This is our last one here?
This one's generic.

00:01:22.281 --> 00:01:25.885
This one could be --
All right.

00:01:25.885 --> 00:01:28.854
What should this one be?
Maybe I'll do this one boozy?

00:01:28.854 --> 00:01:31.190
-Okay.
-All right. Ready?

00:01:31.190 --> 00:01:34.293
[Slurring] Hey, everyone.
Michael Keaton is here tonight.

00:01:34.293 --> 00:01:36.429
Plus we have Heidi Klum...
[Hiccups]

00:01:36.429 --> 00:01:37.763
...and an in-studio
performance --

00:01:37.763 --> 00:01:39.031
Do you like that hiccup?

00:01:39.031 --> 00:01:40.633
[Normal voice] From Vince
Staples featuring Fousheé

00:01:40.633 --> 00:01:42.769
tonight! [Hiccups]

00:01:42.769 --> 00:01:45.605
That was the old way to act.
-Drunk's hard to do.

